the journey to find gold Rogers  legendary treasure has been long and  winding we've crossed the grand line  taken to Kingdoms in the sky and even  gone Toe to Toe with the world  government and although Luffy and his  crew haven't quite made it to the Finish  Line each new adventure has taken him a  step closer to becoming the king of the  Pirates now it's time for you to set  sail with the straw hat crew and have  your very own adventure with them in one  piece Odyssey the upcoming jrpg from  Bandai Namco entertainment Inc here's  everything you need to know about the  game  let's start with the story which is  brand new for the game one day after  minding their own business sailing the  sea the straw hat crew is beset by a  huge storm and they find themselves  stranded on a mysterious island called  wafford separated amidst the chaos Luffy  leads the charge to get the gang back  together and along the way they run into  two brand new characters a Dio and Lim  while adeo decides to help out the crew  Lim unfortunately hates Pirates and  takes the crew's abilities away from  them storing their power in cubes that  are spread out around the island but  she's also able to access Memoria which  is a world made up from the crew's  memories this means that you get to  experience some classic one-piece arcs  as you play through the adventure to  regain your power and uncover the  secrets of Wofford expect to relive key  moments from Alabaster water 7  marineford and dress Rosa and all the  intense emotions that came with those  beloved arcs one piece Odyssey is  similar to traditional jrpgs but of  course there are some one-piece style  twists you can play as the members of  the straw hat crew with each one having  different abilities both in battle and  during exploration enemies will wander  around the world and crossing paths with  them begins a fight battles are  turn-based and it's up to you to choose  the right abilities to emerge Victorious  the rock paper scissors nature of the  battles means that some abilities will  be more effective than others so using  the right ones in the right  circumstances is key to quickly and  decisively securing a victory  twist is that the battlefield is split  up into different areas with enemies and  the crew randomly assigned to different  zones this means that as is often the  case in the Manga and Anime the crew is  split up and Grand battles take place on  multiple fronts you'll need to use each  member of the straw hat crew to their  fullest potential to take out the  enemies that surround them of course as  all one piece fans know you're nothing  without your friends so other crew  members can also help out in skirmishes  so long as you remember your positioning  the dramatic scene system randomizes  aspects of the encounters too so for  example a member of the crew could be  surrounded by enemies and unable to  attack unless you help them out and take  the pressure off them completing the  randomized sub-objectives that pop up  will net you more rewards at the end of  each battle  if you're wandering around the Overworld  and see some shinies you can freely swap  between crew members and use their  abilities to uncover every secret and  hidden trinket Luffy can of course use  his stretchy rubber body to slingshot  himself around and zip across the world  while Zorro can use his expert  swordsmanship to chop down barriers  one piece Odyssey is being developed by  ilka or I love computer art a Japanese  Studio that has worked on many Beloved  jrpgs the music for the game was made by  famed composer motoi sakuraba who has  previously worked on a number of games  in the tales of series as well as the  Dark Souls series the team worked  carefully to ensure that one piece  Odyssey remained loyal to the spirit of  one piece so the characters have the  exaggerated facial features and  expressions they're known for and the  design of the island of wafford was  inspired by various aspects of the  one-piece Universe the game even  features new designs from Hiro Oda the  creator of One Piece who designed new  monsters and creatures including the dry  penguin and Leviathan as well as the new  characters Lim and adeo one piece  Odyssey will launch on January 13 2023  on PlayStation 4 PlayStation 5 Xbox  series X and S and PC and there are a  number of additions available  first up is the standard edition for  59.99 which includes the game and a  pre-order bonus made up of a bunch of  useful items 10 energy apples 10 excite  apples three golden jellies and 100 000  Berry as well as the traveling outfit  set costume for Luffy Zorro Sanji usop  Nami Chopper and Robin this Edition is  available both physically and digitally  the deluxe edition includes the game and  the pre-order bonuses I just mentioned  as well as a few other goodies it also  includes the deluxe pack which includes  two Jewelry accessories and the sniper  King traveling outfit it also contains  the adventure expansion pack which  includes one Ultra useful accessory set  100 000 Berry and an upcoming piece of  story downloadable content the deluxe  edition is 84.99 and is only available  digitally the collector's edition bundle  is available for PS4 PS5 and Xbox it  includes everything from the games  deluxe edition but also comes with a  figurine of Luffy and Lim this Edition  is exclusive to the Bandai Namco store  and will cost you  129.99 so there you have it everything  you need to know about One Piece Odyssey  for more on the game make sure to  subscribe to Gamespot on YouTube and  check out gamespot.com  [Music]
 

